  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Pacific Church Partnerships Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims to build and strengthen partnerships between Pacific and Australian church leaders and faith-based development leaders, and to enable genuine exchange on regional development priorities.  There is a focus on leadership and capacity building in identified areas of mutual priority including: Gender, youth empowerment, disaster response, climate and the advancement of human rights and financial and business management.</narrative>
  </description>
